            <div xml:id="m-67ea8433-9105-445b-8444-622f85e30dda">
              <lg xml:id="m-be82503a-115b-4977-b484-36245a523aa5">
                <l xml:id="m-885780f8-e0c3-4f9d-992b-02f2d176438f" facs="#m-25886b5a-f344-4af6-89a8-85e23b25bb99" label="ambiguous">974</l><l xml:id="m-1436f97f-d4d8-402a-ae27-66f2b1ec5f39" facs="#m-5ea8ee10-e49b-4db7-8e4f-9de85b1e4530" label="text-like">Feast o the Sacred Heart of Jesus.</l><l xml:id="m-6926191b-b791-48a6-8d20-48893c35d25b" facs="#m-11995351-ac5b-4d63-88c6-9511a0e5f80b" label="ambiguous">1 Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem.</l><l xml:id="m-f4b19509-ee65-4ae3-a923-92989e387bce" facs="#m-340f90ea-0e15-4bc7-afa2-58a5b814a10b" label="ambiguous">Joann. 19.</l><l xml:id="m-335ad51f-5319-4ae1-b5d1-aa5b302b9141" facs="#m-3357b9ba-adf4-45f0-b9dd-56cec5cba696" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Judaéi (quóniam) crura, sed unus mílitum láncea</l><l xml:id="m-851347f1-e423-4b0b-bd13-2c9a9ee5f1da" facs="#m-c526bc51-7c6c-41df-bb95-0c0d3f65cf50" label="lyrics-like">1 Parascéve erat), ut non remané¬</l><l xml:id="m-f79c8880-2db5-469e-aa5e-fe59c51675a5" facs="#m-f8f94381-a090-4e20-82f6-7d76143df905" label="lyrics-like">latus ejus apéruit, et continuo exi¬</l><l xml:id="m-3f0c4ef5-37cd-45bd-bb00-838a380a7163" facs="#m-91900002-6f7e-4f82-a8f7-21fe5c1566e5" label="lyrics-like">rent in cruce córpora sábbato (erat</l><l xml:id="m-7419aeab-3e2a-4f06-b4ff-16900d48c9bc" facs="#m-8bd0e26f-de83-431a-b5c8-b38262ade920" label="ambiguous">vit sanguis et aqua. Et qui vidit,</l><l xml:id="m-edb0c4fd-8233-4ede-a0b8-09f69b27bc05" facs="#m-0a72e1d3-ba86-4c79-b186-216b9383745e" label="lyrics-like">enim magnus dies ille sábbati), ro¬</l><l xml:id="m-698e2ad6-dacc-40ee-ad27-ea1766abae00" facs="#m-1192493d-0bf1-485a-ad9a-54e31f7a6cb3" label="lyrics-like">testimónium perhsbuit: et verum</l><l xml:id="m-3c3c2693-67b1-45aa-bab0-aff508b24c76" facs="#m-1c02f462-5ecb-4978-a59b-c991604e06b0" label="lyrics-like">gavérunt Pilátum, ut frangeréntur</l><l xml:id="m-dff55b92-e745-4072-bd74-fefcb95a5096" facs="#m-9c12303c-1a3c-4cf1-a62b-69c58fc1bc01" label="lyrics-like">est testimónium ejus. Et ille scit</l><l xml:id="m-3e8baa8f-32e8-424b-aba5-daba3dd53093" facs="#m-728bfafd-4783-4f93-8445-8f860aad2674" label="lyrics-like">córum crura, et tolleréntur. Vené¬</l><l xml:id="m-101f0b35-958a-44fe-8afc-8dfb0ed1ac8b" facs="#m-3f1da05c-7696-45f1-9fc3-4fa978a20ebf" label="lyrics-like">quia vera dicit, ut et vos credátis.</l><l xml:id="m-1e0d5bb8-2411-41ef-adf0-f7134510a9fc" facs="#m-d1fe98a5-cc21-438d-8544-c25b84d9315e" label="lyrics-like">Facta sunt enim haec ut Scriptúra</l><l xml:id="m-a1023f25-166e-4575-b212-cf39e65bbc71" facs="#m-7221c260-8e32-421d-ba79-4d8fe0bd49f2" label="ambiguous">runt ergo milites: et primi quidem</l><l xml:id="m-7fee159e-b197-4ccb-9f81-2b57accc31a6" facs="#m-7e7bf79d-ed32-47a8-9d21-dd5039d4a4f1" label="lyrics-like">implerétur : Os non comminuétis ex</l><l xml:id="m-e563f84f-7042-4ac3-8123-9b456aada061" facs="#m-79c15edd-8666-43ee-add2-35476b9e0f96" label="lyrics-like">fregérunt crura et altérius, qui cru¬</l><l xml:id="m-91d5aca1-8604-4175-9cc2-1b5f59179611" facs="#m-cb4830fa-53e6-4753-9ec0-4d7d8c4bbe9c" label="lyrics-like">eo. Et sterum ália Scriptura dicit:</l><l xml:id="m-2e6016a6-ce00-488a-b3ad-6bb99270f2d5" facs="#m-46eb029b-6846-494b-ae93-fc1a2569a049" label="ambiguous">cifixus est cum eo. Ad Jesum autem</l><l xml:id="m-96432628-6429-426f-873e-94804c08ff1d" facs="#m-2680d34b-7318-4d42-af33-9b391a917c72" label="lyrics-like">cum venissent, ut vidérunt eum</l><l xml:id="m-5c5a0d68-0824-416b-923c-7d8d5129c780" facs="#m-cb5c8c5b-164b-4069-8458-866f1b881f16" label="lyrics-like">Vidébunt in quem transfixérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-024a8b47-66ec-470e-9ac7-5c2a2793159c" facs="#m-b4f5295b-bbba-4515-97b5-ea027f1fa131" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-210d863e-9e37-4acd-87ff-b22180488183" facs="#m-a64f5612-418a-4c52-ac65-db7804d56613" label="lyrics-like">jam mórtuum, non fregérunt ejus!</l><l xml:id="m-ee278bcf-fdfe-40c2-aed2-396d611cba16" facs="#m-58edf745-92a0-4b85-88b7-1e436e1cfe47" label="ambiguous">ofert.</l><l xml:id="m-28e52e1d-d52e-47c3-a9b1-52c7e28e98c3" facs="#m-1cc7ac39-186c-47d1-bc79-ddd666416c60" label="ambiguous">s.</l><l xml:id="m-1a9e6669-d5b2-447f-a002-b06cb0e1f159" facs="#m-800380a2-a062-4f4c-9866-9489d7236717" label="lyrics-like">M-propé- ri- um* exspectá-vit Cor</l><l xml:id="m-84eda0cb-5ef3-441e-b3cf-f56a340e9e67" facs="#m-08c432f5-67e4-4157-bf19-0bcfe2a13d3d" label="ambiguous">i</l><l xml:id="m-6c9446a9-6388-43aa-b3c9-81431c60ea36" facs="#m-5464698b-78ca-4f86-be8d-a6f12b9ea482" label="lyrics-like">mé¬ um et mi- sé- ri¬</l><l xml:id="m-11653a71-4629-4c2b-b8cb-8408eeb5c331" facs="#m-066d2b67-3774-40d8-a0d5-9afea883905f" label="lyrics-like">am, et sustí- nu¬</l><l xml:id="m-eb1fcc32-f4f0-4ddf-aab6-8f7ccfdbd4d3" facs="#m-26e8f291-5ec2-405a-a0dd-6360ef5ab876" label="lyrics-like">qui simul mé¬ cum contrista-ré- tur</l><l xml:id="m-8a9f710e-6d65-4677-9b93-c854d13a0f73" facs="#m-407cdb79-9752-4376-9369-4f9bed28a4e9" label="ambiguous">et non</l><l xml:id="m-d4e5ab05-da2a-4c29-9b6e-ec7ba68f74e3" facs="#m-b17d2410-f385-4eb2-b19b-cd69257fea21" label="lyrics-like">fú¬ it; con- so-lán-tem me quae-sí¬ vi</l><l xml:id="m-3b296bd9-6d4d-4b7c-ad19-7d1b02c0ef23" facs="#m-41fcd446-d293-4f4b-b7c6-9ac6adf7efac" label="ambiguous">et</l><l xml:id="m-261f5109-d068-45d1-86e9-5b38ca387f8f" facs="#m-720ab29e-0cc0-4166-9f9b-f936fe7341d3" label="lyrics-like">invé¬ ni.</l><l xml:id="m-28175502-8aea-4d2a-b463-c9d6271a3971" facs="#m-08666c62-de73-420b-88c8-103c4ecbcac5" label="ambiguous">non</l><l xml:id="m-993785a7-fada-4f86-967c-716735755760" facs="#m-86424f28-4698-43b8-b2e3-85d039e2a702" label="text-like">In votive Masses in Paschal Time, the above Offertory is replaced by the</l><l xml:id="m-a306aabc-18ea-406a-b276-b914a8421661" facs="#m-c646cac5-0eff-49bb-b7bd-63b9523a80a8" label="ambiguous">following:</l><l xml:id="m-bba1a676-53b4-40c1-939b-ceb0095c5fce" facs="#m-abea25a6-6994-40f4-ac26-ff163a48a3a0" label="ambiguous">orert.&amp;</l><l xml:id="m-56258ad4-8b5e-4027-96d5-4981c94e75bd" facs="#m-9f763136-0b06-42bc-8b75-89d9ee8df1e3" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-0a78ad8e-131a-464d-a7b4-236d516b152c" facs="#m-d18b2d1f-93d8-4f25-9c96-4eb16dc232d4" label="lyrics-like">L Olocáu-stum* et pro peccá- to non postu-lá¬</l><l xml:id="m-b2a1e88c-0ec7-44cf-ad00-09463aa2515f" facs="#m-ac3799a9-5ab4-495b-8a20-23b1d2d51467" label="lyrics-like">In cá-pi-te</l><l xml:id="m-3d23d76c-b5ee-4f8c-a4ee-33e971d7fb1c" facs="#m-7c7278ca-e794-4575-96df-6088964d5359" label="ambiguous">sti;</l><l xml:id="m-b40746d2-2f50-43e8-b26c-1525018bd2d0" facs="#m-dce59260-76f7-48f7-920f-ad00a4cfac56" label="lyrics-like">tunc di¬Ecce véni¬</l><l xml:id="m-43e0816f-c068-4318-9ecc-f5ff1fcee00c" facs="#m-f79d6404-310a-46eb-aec1-46de36c169e4" label="ambiguous">o.</l></lg>
